### 6. View Updates

**File**: `views/results.pug`

**Changes**:
1. Add paragraph rendering section at the top (after h1)
2. Keep existing raw data view for debugging (can hide later)

**New Structure**:
```pug
extends layout

block content
  h1= title

  //- HUMAN-READABLE REPORT
  if project.reportParagraphs && project.reportParagraphs.length > 0
    section.report-content
      each paragraph in project.reportParagraphs
        div(class=`paragraph paragraph-${paragraph.type}`)
          if paragraph.title
            h3.paragraph-title= paragraph.title

          //- Render based on type
          case paragraph.type
            when 'table'
              table.compliance-table
                thead
                  tr
                    each header in paragraph.content.headers
                      th= header
                tbody
                  each row in paragraph.content.rows
                    tr
                      each cell in row
                        td= cell

            when 'list'
              if paragraph.content.listType === 'ordered'
                ol
                  each item in paragraph.content.items
                    li= item
              else
                ul
                  each item in paragraph.content.items
                    li= item

            when 'compliance'
              div(class=`compliance-status compliance-${paragraph.content.status}`)
                p= paragraph.content.content

            when 'requirements'
              div(class=`requirements-priority requirements-${paragraph.content.priority}`)
                p= paragraph.content.content

            when 'info'
            when 'warning'
            when 'danger'
            default
              p= paragraph.content

  //- RAW DATA (for debugging - can be hidden or removed later)
  details
    summary Debug: Raw Processing Data
    h2 Project Information
    //- ... existing raw data display ...
```

